            <br />
            <br />
            Sample certificate file:<br />
            <a href="files/oss.pfx" target="_blank">Certificate</a><br />
            <br />
            The following sample shows how to add a digital signature to a pdf document using ExpertPdf Anywhere.
            <br />
            <br />
            IMPORTANT: Please note that the certificate used is a self signed certificate generated for testing purposes only.
            The signature will appear as not valid in a pdf viewer. Using a valid certificate will result in a valid digital signature.
        </p>
        <p>
